---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /
title: Professional Landscaping in the South Carolina Lowcountry
description: Residential and commercial landscaping, lawn care, hardscaping, irrigation, lighting, and tree services in Bluffton, Beaufort, and Hardeeville.
socialImage: /assets/social/home.jpg
socialImageAlt: Oaktree Landscaping commercial landscape project in Hilton Head Island
---
<section class="hero">
  <img class="hero-image" src="/assets/images/hero.jpg" alt="Professionally maintained commercial landscape by Oaktree Landscaping" width="1800" height="1350" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="container hero-content">
    <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Rooted in the Lowcountry</p>
    <h1>Outstanding landscapes.<br>Breathtaking results.</h1>
    <p>Thoughtful residential and commercial landscaping backed by local experience, meticulous care, and a commitment to lasting beauty.</p>
    <div class="button-group">
      <a class="button button-light" href="/contact/" data-ga-event="cta_click" data-ga-label="hero_estimate">Request an Estimate</a>
      <a class="button button-ghost-light" href="/projects/" data-ga-event="cta_click" data-ga-label="hero_projects">Explore Our Work</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section intro-section">
  <div class="container split">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Welcome to Oaktree Landscaping</p>
      <h2>Landscapes designed around how you live and work.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>With over seven years of landscape-industry experience, our company has become a trusted local name for creating distinctive landscapes and maintaining healthy lawns for residential and commercial properties.</p>
      <p>Every customer has a unique vision. From colorful garden beds and serene water features to corporate site maintenance, we tailor our work to each property with careful attention to detail.</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/about/">Meet Oaktree Landscaping <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="services-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Commercial &amp; Residential Services</p>
        <h2 id="services-title">Complete care for every outdoor space.</h2>
      </div>
      <a class="text-link" href="/services/">View all services <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid card-grid-three">
      {% for service in services %}
        {% if loop.index > 2 %}
          <article class="image-card">
            <img src="{{ service.image | optimizedImage('services') }}" alt="{{ service.name }}" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <div class="image-card-body">
              <h3>{{ service.name }}</h3>
              <p>{{ service.summary }}</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section area-section" aria-labelledby="areas-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-heading section-heading-light">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Proudly Serving the Lowcountry</p>
        <h2 id="areas-title">Local knowledge makes a visible difference.</h2>
      </div>
      <p>We understand the soil, seasons, and coastal conditions that shape landscapes across southern South Carolina.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="area-grid">
      {% for area in areas %}
        <article>
          <span class="area-number">0{{ loop.index }}</span>
          <h3>{{ area.name }}, {{ area.state }}</h3>
          <p>{{ area.description }}</p>
        </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="area-action">
      <p>Not sure whether your property is in our service area?</p>
      <a class="button button-light" href="/contact/" data-ga-event="cta_click" data-ga-label="areas_estimate">Ask Our Team</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="business-title">
  <div class="container business-grid">
    <div class="business-card">
      <p class="eyebrow">Oaktree Landscaping</p>
      <h2 id="business-title">Let’s talk about your property.</h2>
      <a class="button" href="/contact/" data-ga-event="cta_click" data-ga-label="home_business">Request an Estimate</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hours-card">
      <h2>Hours</h2>
      <dl>
        {% for row in site.hours %}
          <div><dt>{{ row[0] }}</dt><dd>{{ row[1] }}</dd></div>
        {% endfor %}
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% include "partials/cta.njk" %}
